  "prefLabel": "We 302.04 Individual May Be Licensed",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 302.04 Individual May Be Licensed.\n\n(a) More than one individual of a partnership may be licensed.\n\n(b) Individual employees of a licensed corporation may be licensed.\n\n(c) Each licensed individual shall pay an annual license fee.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for We 300) #12083 eff 3-1-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/we100-1000.html"
